    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t L\u00e6cedemonie ofer hie ricsian mehten swa hie \u00e6r Hie sendon \u00fea on Perse \u00e6fter Conone, & hine b\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t he him on fultume w\u00e6re. & he him \u00fe\u00e6s getyg\u00feade & hie mid micle sciphere gesohte, & hie L\u00e6cedemonie m\u00e6st ealle \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Conon gelende to Ahtena \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, his ealdcy\u00fe\u00fee, & \u00fe\u00e6r mid micle gefean \u00feara \u00c6fter \u00feeosan gewinne gewear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6tte Perse gebudan fri\u00f0 eallum Creca folce, n\u00e6s na for \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Ac L\u00e6cedemonie h\u00e6fdon \u00fea hwile maran unstillnessa \u00feonne hie m\u00e6genes h\u00e6fden, & w\u00e6ron \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Thebane hie mid firde gesohton, & him L\u00e6cedemonie o\u00fere ongean brohton. \u00dea hie longe fuhton, \u00fea cleopade L\u00e6cedemonia ealdormon to Arcadium, & b\u00e6den \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00f0\u00e6s \u00de\u00e6t is mid Crecum \u00feeaw \u00fe\u00e6t mid \u00f0\u00e6m worde bi\u00f0 gecy\u00feed hw\u00e6\u00f0er healf h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00feonne sige. For \u00feon ic wolde gesecgan, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, hu Creca gewinn angan, \u00fee of L\u00e6cedemonia \u00f0\u00e6re byrg Ic sc\u00e6l eac \u00fey lator Romana istoria asecgan \u00fee ic angunnen h\u00e6fde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s III hunde wintra & LXXVI, w\u00e6s in Achie eor\u00febeofung, & Ic m\u00e6g eac on urum agnum tidum gelic anginn \u00fe\u00e6m gesecgan, \u00feeh hit swelcne ende n\u00e6fde, \u00fe\u00e6tte On \u00fe\u00e6m burgum w\u00e6s get",
